<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 73 0 R
/E (In conclusion, the estimation of vaporpressure and enthalpy of vaporization is essential for ensuring the safety and efficiency of industrial processes involving volatile gases. Through our analysis using the Clausius Clapeyron Equation, Antoine Equation, and Peng-Robinson EOS, we have gained valuable insights into the behavior of the gas under various conditions. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
